    apply: "Pray Psalm 139:23-24 each day this week. Ask a trusted friend, What is one thing I do that you think I may not see? Listen without defending. Record any excuses you notice yourself making. Read James 1:22-25 and choose one thing to act on.",
    activity: "Read 2 Samuel 12:1-7 and discuss how David's judgement of the parable exposed him. Present short scenarios that include rationalisations and ask learners to name them. Practise a prayer of examination in silence for two minutes.",
    takeHome: "Read Jeremiah 17:5-10, Psalm 139, James 1:19-27 and 2 Samuel 11-12. Write down three questions to ask yourself each evening. Memorise Psalm 139:23-24.",
