    teacher: "Avoid prompting morbid introspection. Combine self-examination with assurance of forgiveness. Be careful with learners who tend toward scrupulosity. Encourage examining behaviour and motives with trusted friends, and trusting God's grace.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners how self-deception works and how Psalm 139:23-24 helps.",
    mcq1: ["What does Jeremiah 17:9 say about the heart?", ["The heart is deceitful above all things", "The heart is always right", "The heart is pure", "The heart is irrelevant"], 0, "The heart can deceive."],
