    sa: ["How can believers keep integrity under pressure?", ["fear of god", "flee", "consistent", "courage", "trust", "support"], "A good answer says integrity is rooted in fear of God, flees temptation, stays consistent, trusts God whether or not he rescues, and relies on prayer and companions."],
