    summary: "This session is the final examination week for the Integrity, Honesty and Godly Character course. The examination covers all twenty-four lessons, with emphasis on God as truth, the meaning of integrity, honest and loving speech, promises, honest work, money and citizenship, private integrity, hypocrisy and self-deception, honesty with God, integrity under pressure, courage, relationships, leaders, digital honesty, repair after failure, reputation and growth in character.",
